WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,840
The old rule is to take turns with hand sanitizer

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:06,000
Three people usually take turns every two hours

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,360
Those who are taught will go to bed now, and those who are not taught will stay in the first shift.

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:15,290
Fatty, you take the two newcomers first.

5
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:22,110
A must-have

6
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:25,110
Brother Ling, when can we leave here?

7
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:28,140
I don’t know. It’s only one day that I can survive.

8
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:31,140
To be honest, I really admire you throughout this journey.

9
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,640
From the first day to now, if it weren't for you

10
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,140
We've already died eight hundred times

11
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,000
Just helping each other

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,120
By the way, you seem to have never had any acquaintances.

13
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:43,040
i have no friends

14
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,540
why do you say that

15
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:48,040
We are both short and ugly. No one wants to have a close relationship with me.

16
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:51,540
I was bullied when I was in school, but I was still a bit transparent at work.

17
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:54,540
You are the first one who is willing to open your eyes and look at me
